# Changelog

This repository does not require a product CHANGELOG or MinVer release ritual.

If `CHANGELOG.md` exists, add a bullet under `## [Unreleased]` for user-visible
sample changes in the same change. Use Keep a Changelog categories (`Added`,
`Changed`, `Fixed`, `Removed`, `Deprecated`, `Security`). Write the bullet in
user voice, not commit voice. Do not invent a version heading.

If there is no `CHANGELOG.md`, skip changelog updates.

Skip: internal refactors with no behavior change, test-only work,
comment or formatting-only edits, and private planning files.
